 "words_heard": 169,
 "words": 170,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The hour has come for the Son of Man to be glorified",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A grain of wheat falls into the earth and dies",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It remains alone if it does not break",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if it dies, it bears much fruit in the end",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever loves his life loses it in this world",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever hates his life keeps it for eternal life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone serves me, he must follow me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where I am, there my servant will be also",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Father will honor him who serves me here",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul is troubled now, what shall I say",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, save me from this hour of pain",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No, for this purpose I came to this hour",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone serves me, he must follow me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where I am, there my servant will be also",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Father will honor him who serves me here",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, glorify your name in this moment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A voice came from heaven, I have glorified it",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I will glorify it again, said the voice",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Where I am, there my servant will be",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
